  "name": "Official Players Kit, 2005 mail order",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A kit that members of Japan's Pokémon Card Game Players Club could order by post from June 2005 until the end of January 2006; some event venues sold it to non-members too. It held a carrying box, a playmat, damage counters and their case, and a file, with three holofoil Pokémon ex drawn by Ryo Ueda: Kyogre ex 027/PLAY, Groudon ex 028/PLAY and Rayquaza ex 029/PLAY. The same art came in English as Nintendo Black Star Promos 37, 38 and 39.",
